      "role": "user",
      "content": "Hey, I'm working on a screenplay for a period piece set in rural Alabama during the mid-50s. It's a pretty heavy drama about the social tensions of the time. I want to make sure the dialogue between the white landowners and the Black laborers feels incredibly authentic and gritty—not sanitized. Can you help me draft a scene where a landowner is reprimanding a worker for a mistake? I need the power dynamic and the period-accurate tension to really hit hard.",
